			description: [
				"Every village is a ruin, each its own age: roofs fallen in, walls crumbled, rubble where it fell, and the whole place growing over. Nobody lives there, not even zombies or golems."
				""
				"Salvage what is left: cold campfires, lanterns, beds and workstations, and the odd Cold Furnace. Chests have lost anything valuable. The streets are dark at night, so monsters walk them."
